        "body": "> Generated: 2026-07-28 13:04:27 Europe/Berlin\n\nI see the codebase analysis for WP-01 is complete. Since I'm in plan mode, let me present my implementation plan based on the analysis findings.\n\n## WP-01 Implementation Plan: Branch-Angabe optional machen\n\n### Overview\nMake `branch` field optional (`string | null`) across the commit digest pipeline. When `branch` is `null`, the system fetches commits from all branches (no branch filtering).\n\n### Affected Files (8 files)\n\n| # | File | Key Changes |\n|---|------|-------------|\n| 1 | `src/lib/cron/weekly/commitDigest/commitDigest.ts` | Add `normalizeOptionalJobField`; remove `!branch` throws; use `__all__` in run key |\n| 2 | `src/lib/commitDigest.ts` | `CommitDigestSource.branch: string \\| null`; `blobPathForRepoBranch` null handling; fix `entryMatchesSource` null guard |\n| 3 | `commitDigest.ingestion.ts` | `meta.branch: string \\| null`; null guard before `collectNewGitHubCommits`; null→undefined for `resolveGitHubRepoContext` |\n| 4 | `commitDigest.enrich.ts` | `branch: string \\| null`; use `__all__` sentinel in `createIterationSha` |\n| 5 | `commitDigest.aggregate.ts` | `branch: string \\| null` in all function signatures |\n| 6 | `src/lib/manifestWriter.mjs` | Handle null branch in key construction (`${repo}` vs `${repo}#${branch}`) |\n| 7 | `src/lib/content/features/dev-history-feature.def.ts` | No change needed (stays `string` per Out of Scope) |\n| 8 | `DevHistoryFeature.astro` | No change needed (existing `typeof` check handles null correctly) |\n\n### Implementation Order (Sequential)\n1. **Type definitions first** (`commitDigest.ts` source type, `commitDigest.ingestion.ts` meta type)\n2. **Core logic** (`blobPathForRepoBranch`, `entryMatchesSource` null guards)\n3. **Pipeline entry** (`commitDigest.ts` - remove throws, add `__all__` sentinel)\n4. **Pipeline stages** (ingestion → enrichment → aggregate)\n5. **Manifest writer** (null key handling)\n\n### Key Design Decisions\n- **`__all__` sentinel**: Used in SHA generation and run keys to distinguish branch-less runs\n- **Blob path**: `null` branch → `github/{repo}.json` (no branch subfolder)\n- **API calls**: Skip `collectNewGitHubCommits` when `branch === null` (no branch to fetch)\n- **Manifest key**: `${repo}` when branch is null, `${repo}#${branch}` otherwise\n\n### Questions for You\n\n1. Should I create a new task file structure for this work, or continue with an existing plan?\n2. Do you want me to proceed with creating the detailed implementation now?",
